      "text": "",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 30,
      "text": "​\n\n내부\n\n​\n\n내부는 식사할 수 있게\n\n테이블이 있습니다.\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 31,
      "text": " ",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTdfMjQ4/MDAxNzY4NjUxNjQ0MDY5.VnF1ppmiZeAC0E6yNSAqxsFU0Q5vVuTgCF9Do4yzsNIg.yJOAmFLrzqgpTBOzVt347i2Q1ngl44_R_j1ZwLjmLhQg.JPEG/SE-19beeac7-0e96-4ea4-8e8c-a54b3116b2c3.jpg?type=w80_blur",
