        },
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMjgg/MDAxNzY4MTQyNDM4ODA2.Kh6rbqm40Hg7-OnMEP4MtQQDMg4uHGxqgvNZlpzxxDwg.hQapxCm9xUyNdp32QxQIm5U9pYqXncwx-yYSZR1q8pkg.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_24_IMG_6184.JPG?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMjgg/MDAxNzY4MTQyNDM4ODA2.Kh6rbqm40Hg7-OnMEP4MtQQDMg4uHGxqgvNZlpzxxDwg.hQapxCm9xUyNdp32QxQIm5U9pYqXncwx-yYSZR1q8pkg.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_24_IMG_6184.JPG?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 32,
      "text": "​\n\n테이블에는 이렇게\n\n오뎅을 찍어 먹을 수 있도록\n\n간장과 종지가 있습니다.\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 33,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMjI0/MDAxNzY4MTQyNDUzNTMx.5MS7QI_7aVE_ViXP32h5gX15YCuP4zU2TOkCcAS5Jc0g.EoMosvAn8R_TmYeTXew5BeVUtthvCDBLe1h7hSH1Q_og.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_18_IMG_6167.JPG?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMjI0/MDAxNzY4MTQyNDUzNTMx.5MS7QI_7aVE_ViXP32h5gX15YCuP4zU2TOkCcAS5Jc0g.EoMosvAn8R_TmYeTXew5BeVUtthvCDBLe1h7hSH1Q_og.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_18_IMG_6167.JPG?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 34,
      "text": "​\n\n주문 중에 준비된 음식을 바라봅니다.\n\n떡볶이 국물이 사진은 저래 보이지만\n\n한 번 저으니\n\n색감이 살아나 엄청나게\n\n먹고 싶어지는 떡볶이였습니다.\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 35,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMTk5/MDAxNzY4MTQyNDA4MTg2.a587oNJtxeEogcg7oUxzia3sFHFmqrv365g6AS6_HK0g.QCkFDrePjXRAa1s6XGt3mafU85ObchX4ozYMqoosbsgg.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_17_IMG_6164.JPG?type=w80_blur",
