        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 40,
      "text": "​\n\n오뎅국물도 한 컵 주십니다.\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 41,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMjc0/MDAxNzY4MTQyNTM2NzE4.5A2fkuiHrN6W6P-j2zTZ31L-viiL1cIjvXw4cgvV6vkg.OM1iIczcRWvDEdBpRdeXjwhiBjJWB3DQcRQCaQddUccg.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_18_IMG_6169.JPG?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMjc0/MDAxNzY4MTQyNTM2NzE4.5A2fkuiHrN6W6P-j2zTZ31L-viiL1cIjvXw4cgvV6vkg.OM1iIczcRWvDEdBpRdeXjwhiBjJWB3DQcRQCaQddUccg.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_18_IMG_6169.JPG?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 42,
      "text": "​\n\n종지에 간장을 넣어주고\n\n식사 준비를 합니다.\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 43,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMjQ4/MDAxNzY4MTQyNTg4OTE3.CtJTDnvKhui_0bSYmSgL5egndcvmmxjR0QbHC6HoAOkg.6z065gwIb687n3gglQyZPgXwXajmtVouLpXsAN3xxhYg.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_18_IMG_6170.JPG?type=w80_blur",
          "full": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMjQ4/MDAxNzY4MTQyNTg4OTE3.CtJTDnvKhui_0bSYmSgL5egndcvmmxjR0QbHC6HoAOkg.6z065gwIb687n3gglQyZPgXwXajmtVouLpXsAN3xxhYg.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_18_IMG_6170.JPG?type=w80_blur"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "n": 44,
      "text": "​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 45,
      "text": "",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 46,
      "text": "​\n\n식사 시작\n\n​\n\n매운맛을 먼저 먹으면\n\n일반 오뎅은 맛을 느끼기 힘들기에\n\n일반 오뎅부터 먹습니다.\n\n​",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "n": 47,
      "text": "",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://mblogthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjAxMTFfMTA4/MDAxNzY4MTQyNjc1ODg0.J107FGe6i_cMFjdHdk3y3MGy51FUdOLHbapWbr6o_0Mg.1thZr13rBApjlaLdVeGfhwG9UKwSaWyAKiw-ZQJKYqog.JPEG/2025_12_29_20_18_IMG_6172.JPG?type=w80_blur",
